      "name": "Question 14",
      "problem": "Let $x,y,$ and $z$ be integers. If $x∣z,$ $y∣z,$ and $\\text{gcd}(x,y)=1$ then{{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "For any integers $x,$ $y,$ and $z,$ we have that\n\n$$\nx∣z,\\,y∣z,\\,\\text{and}\\,\\text{gcd}(x,y)=1\\,⟹\\,xy∣z.\n$$",
